## 🏗️ Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                               CLIENT INTERFACES                             │
│       Web Dashboard (SPA)   │   REST API (FastAPI)   │   CLI (Typer+Rich)   │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬───────────────────────┬───────┘
                       │                      │                       │
┌──────────────────────▼──────────────────────▼───────────────────────▼───────┐
│                              TASKFORGE CORE ENGINE                          │
│     Async Scheduler (APScheduler)   │   EventBus   │   Metrics Exporter     │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────┘
               │                                              │
┌──────────────▼─────────────┐                  ┌─────────────▼───────────────┐
│          TRIGGERS          │                  │          EXECUTORS          │
│ • CronTrigger (Crontab)    │                  │ • ShellExecutor             │
│ • IntervalTrigger (Timer)  │                  │ • PythonCallableExecutor    │
│ • WebhookTrigger (HTTP)    │                  │ • HTTPExecutor (httpx)      │
│ • OneShotTrigger (Date)    │                  │ • DockerExecutor (CLI)      │
└──────────────┬─────────────┘                  └─────────────┬───────────────┘
               │                                              │
┌──────────────▼──────────────────────────────────────────────▼───────────────┐
│                               STORAGE LAYER                                 │
│               SQLiteStorage (aiosqlite)  │  PostgreSQL (asyncpg)            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

See [`architecture.json`](./architecture.json) for the machine-readable architectural specification.

---

## ⚙️ Configuration Variables

All configuration is handled via environment variables (12-factor pattern):

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `TASKFORGE_STORAGE_URL` | `sqlite+aiosqlite:///taskforge.db` | Async DB connection URL |
| `TASKFORGE_SECRET_KEY` | *(auto-generated)* | Secret key for tokens & sessions |
| `TASKFORGE_LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | Logging verbosity (`debug`, `info`, `warning`, `error`) |
| `TASKFORGE_METRICS_ENABLED` | `true` | Expose Prometheus metrics at `/metrics` |
| `TASKFORGE_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` | Server bind address |
| `TASKFORGE_PORT` | `8080` | Server listen port |
| `TASKFORGE_CORS_ORIGINS` | `*` | Allowed CORS origins for the API |

