## 📂 Project Structure

```
TaskForge_DevOps_Tools/
├── dashboard/              # Single-page web dashboard (HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JS)
│   ├── index.html          # Main SPA layout with 9 view panels
│   ├── styles.css          # Design tokens, themes (dark/light), animations
│   └── app.js              # State management, Chart.js, live API integration
├── taskforge/              # Core Python package
│   ├── core/               # Scheduler engine, event bus, config, metrics, logging
│   ├── jobs/               # Job & JobRun models, retry strategy
│   ├── triggers/           # Cron, Interval, Webhook, OneShot triggers
│   ├── executors/          # Shell, Python, HTTP, Docker execution engines
│   ├── storage/            # Async SQLite storage backend
│   ├── api/                # FastAPI application, routers (jobs, runs, system, plugins)
│   ├── plugins/            # Extensibility plugin loader & base classes
│   ├── notifications/      # Alert notification interfaces
│   └── cli/                # Rich Typer CLI commands
├── examples/               # Example job configurations (JSON)
│   └── hello_world_job.json
├── docker/                 # Container configs (Dockerfile, compose, prometheus)
├── .github/workflows/      # CI/CD automation pipelines
├── pyproject.toml          # Package metadata & dependencies
├── architecture.json       # System architecture definition
├── install-steps.txt       # Step-by-step setup guide for Windows PowerShell
└── README.md               # Project documentation
```

